{"series":{"id":"fighter-destiny-3d","slug":"fighter-destiny-3d","title":"Fighter of the Destiny 3D","image":"https://donghualife.com/images/webp/fighter-destiny-3d-1__coverImage.webp","synopsis":"Elegir es decidir, y esta es una historia sobre el peso de nuestras elecciones. Ante tres mil mundos poblados por dioses y demonios, basta un pergamino taoísta para reclamar el control del universo.En el origen de los tiempos, un meteorito místico cayó en el Continente Oriental portando runas misteriosos; mediante ellas, la humanidad alcanzó la comprensión del Dao y fundó la Ortodoxia. Milenios después, Chen Changsheng, un huérfano de catorce años, parte del lado de su maestro para hallar la cura a su enfermedad y desafiar su propio destino; con una promesa matrimonial como unico equipaje, se encamina hacia la capital para dar inicio a la odisea de un héroe legendario.Estudio: Shenman Culture Autor: 猫腻 (Mao Ni) | Ever Night / swordsman","genres":["Acción","Drama","Aventura","Romance","Artes marciales","Cultivo"],"sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/series/fighter-destiny-3d","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:00.924Z"},"seasons":[{"id":"fighter-destiny-3d-1","slug":"fighter-destiny-3d-1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fighter-destiny-3d-1-1","image":null,"number":1,"seriesId":"fighter-destiny-3d","firstEpisodeUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fighter-destiny-3d-1-1","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:19.906Z","episodeCount":26,"minEpisodeFound":1,"maxEpisodeFound":26,"missingEpisodes":[],"paginationComplete":true,"initialSyncComplete":true}],"episodes":[{"id":"fighter-destiny-3d-1-1","slug":"fighter-destiny-3d-1-1","title":"Fighter of the Destiny 3D — Cap. 1","sourceUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fighter-destiny-3d-1-1","servers":[],"previousUrl":null,"nextUrl":"https://donghualife.com/watch/fighter-destiny-3d-1-2","updatedAt":"2026-10-24T21:37:01.608Z","seriesId":"fighter-destiny-3d","seasonId":"fighter-destiny-3d-1","number":1,"releaseDate":null},{"id":"fighter-